---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service - Phinisi Network">
  <Header />
  
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-8 md:p-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">Terms of Service</h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 font-['Inter'] leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-100 pb-6">Last updated: August 2, 2026</p>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>By accessing or using the Phinisi Network platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of the terms, you may not access the service.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">2. Use of Platform</h2>
            <p>You agree to use this platform only for lawful learning and self-development purposes. You are strictly prohibited from distributing, modifying, reselling, or copying our course materials without explicit written permission from Phinisi Network.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">3. User Accounts</h2>
            <p>You are responsible for safeguarding the password that you use to access the service and for any activities or actions under your password. Sharing your account with others is a violation of these terms.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">4. Refund Policy</h2>
            <p>Your satisfaction is our priority. All course purchases are subject to our 7-day refund policy from the date of purchase, provided that no more than 20% of the course material has been accessed.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 font-['Hanken_Grotesk']">5. Changes to Terms</h2>
            <p>We reserve the right to modify or replace these Terms at any time to adapt to current regulations. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to this page. Your continued use of the Service constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
